#3
&+gAn Overgrown Trail in the Forbidden Forest of the Khomani-Khan~
   &+gAn overgrown, seldom-used trail faintly crawls deeper east
&+ginto the forbidden forest of the Khomani-Khan. The jungle is
&+gthick and shadowy, darkened by the thick canopy of tall, robust
&+gtrees. Countless species of flower and fauna thrive off the
&+glush, temperate forest, as the air is always alive with the
&+gsounds of nature. These forests are rumored to inhabit the
&+gKhomani-Khan, lored to be feared cat-people of unknown origin.
~
