&+yAn Arched Entryway Gate &+WThrough a Stone Wall&N~
   &+WThe grandiose walls of an ancient, blocked stone temple opens
&+Gthrough a huge arched gateway directly south through here.
&+WA massive metal gate is practically rusted shut and it is nearly
&+Gcovered in thick jungle vines. It does not appear as this
&+Wgate is opened very often, yet it does seem to have an overt
&+Gmagical essence to it, as it begins to glow when approached.
&+WLarge glyphs on the sides of the temple walls depict several
&+Gtabaxi cat people following-in-worship a larger tabaxi, whom
&+Wis presumably their deity and creator, Ubtao.
~
