riverbend for the River Olung, flowing southward. Beyond the river,
further west, a tall stone tower looks out over the horizon. To the north,
the tall cypress trees of the Forbidden Forest of the Khomani-Khan
envelope everything past the shore. A small, but lively tabaxi temple-city
thrives east of here.
