&+YAn Open Courtyard Inside the &+yGates of &+LM&+ra&+Ln&+rs&+Lh&+ra&+Lk&+ra~
   &+yThis large, open courtyard sits between the spiked-wood walls of
&nthe Blood Arena, south of here, and the great towering gates of
&+yManshaka to the north. The dirt road extends north, past the gates,
&nand further east and west through the bustling slave city.
&+yAll around slavers of different races can be seen leading caravans
&nof their stock around, breaking up rabbles and exchanging goods
&+ywith one another. Weapons, potions, pelts, slaves, food and
&npoisons galore, this open city's only rule is that its denizens
&+yrespect it's keepers with proper tithes, no matter the cargo.
~
