&nof their stock around, breaking up rabbles and exchanging goods
&+ywith one another. Weapons, potions, pelts, slaves, food and
&npoisons galore, this open city's only rule is that its denizens
&+yrespect it's keepers with proper tithes, no matter the cargo.
