&+YAn Open &+GS&+Rl&+Ga&+Rv&+Ge &+YMarket&N~
   &+RThis hillside, possibly the crest on which Manshaka rests,
at the heart of the city serves as the primary slave trade
&+Rlocation for many. A constant circus of slave troupes, buyers,
sellers, merchants and traders of other goods and services
&+R(legal only in free cities such as Manshaka), and a seemingly
sleepless rabble of activity fills this court. The east and
&+Rwest are flanked by huge blocked stone buildings, while the
courtyard opens to the north and south intersections of
&+Rdirt roads and Drudach street.
