Entry Foyer &+Rof the Blood Arena&N~
&+r   The Blood Arena of Manshaka is a a huge circular enclosure
&+Rof carved-sharpened log-work walls wherein a massive pit, accessed
&+rby small thatch-work ramp, holds the bloodiest gladiator duels
&+Rknown on this horizon of Duris. Beasts, independant warriors,
&+rand most-of-all slave fighters are forced into live-or-die combat
&+Ragainst one another, as they always have by tradition in Manshaka.
&+rAround the pit hunch the bloodthirsty slave-merchants, showgoers,
&+Rvisitors, and Manshaka guard, watching the gorey violence.
~
