#174
&+rBase of a &ND&+ri&nm&+rl&Ny&+r-&NL&+ri&nt &+rMinaret&N~
   &+rPrivate from the tumultuous rabble of the Blood Arena's
common spectators, this small, slender tower sits within the
&+rnorthwest corner, overlooking the notorious gladiator pit
below. Reserved for royalty and Manshaka leadership, access
&+rto the minaret is commonly known to be forbidden with a
heavy presence of guards. Only one singular torch, located
&+rroughly 15 feet high on the wall, illuminates this other-
wise dim and narrow staircase.
~
