&+WThe Fro&+Yt&+yhy Cistern&N~
   &+LThis old tavern was likely built directly into the wooden walls
&nof Manshaka itself, sitting just west of the legendary Blood Arena.
&+LThe tavern constantly hosts travelers and denizens alike, along
&nwith the baggage that comes with raucous types attracted to combat
&+Land gambling. The Frothy Cistern is smokey and dim, and constantly
&nbusy with rowdy patrons from all corners. The taproom features a
&+Lmassive wooden bar and an open wooden floor full of tables and
&nchairs. The tavern continues through a smoke-filled backroom.
