therein, this large, stone building is built directly into the earth,
&+Yseemingly helping support the carved-log walled infrastructure
surrounding the port itself. A huge ancient iron vault creeks and
&+Ygroans as it is forced opened and closed, regularly maintained with
oil and smithy care. The Iron Vault is heavily guarded, as one might
