&+gvines slopes downwards into more dense vegetation. The moss-
&+gcovered blocks of a stone bridge can barely be made out
&+gthrough the thicket, on its western edge. The air is humid
&+gand full of tiny flies that seem to follow anything that
&+gbreathes.
