&+mcorners and seemingly any livable nook around the ramadas,
&+Moffering simple shelter to the proprietors of these jungle
&+mshops. Huge tapestries cover the interiors of these tent-shops,
&+Mcolorizing the otherwise shady forest ruins with vibrancy.
~
