#216
&+LBase of a Gargantuan Dark Cypress~
   &+LA massive cypress tree, roughly fifteen feet wide and a hundred feet
&+Ltall completely dominates a wide expanse in the jungle, causing limited
&+Ltreegrowth within the behemoth's shadow, resulting in a thick fern-land
&+Lsurrounding basin. Gnarled, ancient limbs twist out from the super-tree
&+Llike that of folklore that might house giants. A dark mist squelches
&+Lvision through the jungle, forcing a mystery out of what lies above.
   &+LThe eastern ridge beyond this ancient cypress drops sharply amongst
&+Lseveral large rocky outcroppings, eventually descending into a shallow
&+Lbut steady river.
~
