#217
&+BThe Swift-Moving River Olung&N~
   &+BThis swift rapids crash and explode in misty bursts along the
&+Btwisting jagged descent as it churns southward.  Several breaks
&+Bin the water fork at thousands of small waterfalls as the
&+Bfresh current finds its way down and around mountainous rocks,
&+Bfollowing the path it's eroded for many, many years. Other
&+Bwaterfalls, some large forming their own flowing pools and others
&+Bsmall, barely recovering from their own splash, coalesce into
&+Bthe main, several-feet-deep Olung river.
~
