&+gA Hallway of &+YThe Broken Mast&N~
   &+gThis second floor hallway of the Broken Mast is very posh,
&+Ya stark contrast from the rest of the dock. The entire building
&+gis made of oversized stained timber, built massively to the
&+Yscale of the giant minotaurs. The same timber makes up the
&+genormous doors that lead into simple, but effective quarters.
&+YThe structural diversity of Manshaka is evident, as the owners
&+gof such buildings are likely their usurpers from long ago.
&+Ylarge glassless windows are interlaced between the chambers,
&+gcasting spacious views upon the bustling streets or harbor
&+Ybelow, depending on what side of the building one is facing.
