&+gGuests' Quarters of &+YThe Broken Mast&N~
   &+gAll guests' quarters of The Broken Mast are simply massive,
&+Yspaciously accomodating the seafaring minotaurs for whom they
&+gwere originally intended. Each of the chambers features a huge
&+Ywooden bunkbed and a large chest beneath a glassless window
&+goverlooking either the bay or the city. A 'small' shelved
&+Ycloset with a few mounted hooks is built into the wall behind
&+gthe door. A single lantern hangs from a central hook beside
&+Ythe bunkbed.
~
1 33554432 0
D1
&+yA huge &+Lstained &+ywooden door leads out to the hallway of the inn.
~
door~
1 0 277
