#283
&+LA Massive &+yCellar &+LL&+ya&+Ln&+yd&+Li&+yn&+Lg&N~
   &+LA wide, stone staircase leads down to this huge, open
&+ycellar that now acts as a junction between the foyer
&+Lbarroom, above, and the more 'exclusive' areas that aren't
&+ynearly as front-facing. A brief den, filled with smoke
&+Land the occasional eruption of the sounds of brutality
&+yevident from close-quartered melee, is to the west, while
&+Lan eastern arch opens to a second barroom, converted from
&+yan ancient cask storage hold.
~
