&+b   With waves broken by a mountainous, crescent-shaped reef that
&+Bwraps along the southern coast like a raven's talon, this great
&+bbay has much calmer waters than the surrounding surf - a break
&+Bfrom the surf's constant barrage of the isle of the Khomani-Khan.
&+bParts of the reef peak out of the water on small isles, forming
&+Ba brief, but hazardous rocky archipelago just off the southern
&+bshore.
