&+yBelow a Wooden Guard Tower&N~
   &+yThis tall, two-story guard tower overlooks the gates of
&+yManshaka, the city streets, and the rocky ravine leading
&+ytowards the great port. The tower is made of several large
&+ytimbers of char-cured hardwood, built into a lattice design
&+ythat provides support for multiple heavy bodies. A long,
&+yrickety catwalk of planked wood extends in a bridge above
&+ythe gates, where sentries may shout down at interlopers.
