#470
&+CA Bustling &+BTrade Guild &+COffice&N~
   &+CThis large hearth chamber has been converted into an
&+Loffice, where dock-runners scamper in and out carrying
&+Cscrolls of important documents, samples of inventories,
&+Lbribes from foreigners and reports of smugglers. Four
&+Cmassive tables are aligned, two on the north-face and
&+Ltwo on the south, where lines of dock-runners may queue
&+Cto submit materials before receiving approval (almost
&+Lnever rejection) to the awaiting vessels on the docks.
&+CTwin staircases lead up from the center of the foyer
&+Lonto an observation lounge, above - a converted bedroom
&+Cfrom the previous occupants of this former-mansion.
~
