#471
&+RA Loft Balcony&N~
   &+RThis small loft has two small doorless chambers that
&+Rbranch off to the east, likely former bedrooms, and a
&+Rquaint wooden balcony that overlooks the foyer below.
&+RThe ceiling is made of inclined wooden beams that join
&+Rat the center, upon which planked slats have been sealed
&+Rwith several thick coats of burnt oil-paint. A huge,
&+Rwooden-doored &+Cwindow &+Ron the southern wall looks out
&+Rupon the picturesque Dalvik's Bay.
~
