#473
&+yA Cramped &+rBarracks&N~
   &+yPoorly-hung elements of armor and chainmail are draped
&+cacross armor racks that have haphazardly toppled into
&+yother armor-clad racks on one side of the chamber, while
&+cspears and swords in various states of condition litter
&+ythe corners.  Several small, round tables and stools
&+care placed throughout, while a small hearth burns steadily
&+yat the center of the chamber. A large staircase at the
&+cend opposite of the entrance leads up to a bunk chamber.
~
